    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yehova wacu ira kumae, Gam iri ban ma dit, man ikieu i wie ku! kalamu mi pi mi dhanu kumae, Ni Maher-calal-hac-baz; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man abigamu ira jumulembe mandha kara gikieu, en e Uria ma jalam, ku Zekaria ma wod Yeberekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E acidho ba dhaku ma jabila; e egamu ie, man enyolo nyathin ma nico. E Yehova lund uwacu ira ku! mae, Lwong’ nyinge Maher-calal-hac-baz. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ma fodi nyathinne bibedo ku ng’e, yong’ec mi ywak kumae ngo, Vwa, man, Ma, e lonyo mi Dameski kud ayeki mi Samaria jubiyaku i wang’ ubimo mir Ascur.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yehova yero ira kendo, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum calu dhanu maeni gikwero pi mi Ciloa ma mol lwe lwe, man anyong’a negogi kum Rezin ku wod Remalia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka kumeno kawono, nen, Rwoth bikelo pi mi Kulo, ma tek man dupa, en e ubimo mir Ascur ku dwong’ pare ceke i wigi: man ebiidho malu wi kamol mi pi ceke, e ebicore wi ng’et kulone ceke; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ebicore i Yuda; ebimwonye man ebikadhu kud i ie; ebitundo cil kum ng’ut; e riec mi bombe bipong’o kalac mi ng’om peri, E Imanuel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuyakni, E kodhidhanu, man wutur nziki nziki; e wucik ithwu, wun ceke ma wuni i ng’om ma ngbir: wutwiru giwu, man wutur nziki nizki; wutwiru giwu, man wutur nziki nziki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wupor lembe karacelo, e jubidwoke mananu; wuyer lembe, e ebicungo ngo: kum Mungu ni karacelo kudwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Yehova yero kumeni ira ku cing’ ma tek, man eponja ya kud awoth i yo mi dhanu maeni, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.3.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kud wuwac kumae, Rop, kum gin ceke ma dhanu maeni biwacu pire kumae, Rop; kadi kud wulwor lworo migi, kadi bebe de kud umakwu pire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova mir udul, wubidwoke leng’ en; man wuwek ebed lworo mu, man wuwek ebed bebe mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebibedo ni kamaleng’; ento ni kidi mi redhojo man ni kidi mi kier ni udi mir Israel ario, ni ngbak man ni uwic ni ju m’ubedo i Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dupa bikier i wie, e gibipodho, man gibitur, e jubimakugi, man jubiyakugi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twi lembatuca, mwon ayi kum cik kind julubna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.2.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebr 2:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E abikuro Yehova, m’upanu wang’e ni ot pa Yakobo, e abikie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.2.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebr 2:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nen, an ku nyithindho ma Yehova mio ira wan wa mi giranyutha ku musana i Israel m’uai ba Yehova mir udul, m’ubedo wi got Sayuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma gibiwacu iwu kumae, Wuyeny ba ju ma weg tipo man bang’ ajoga, ma kok man ma weco mung’ mung’: maku dhanu yeny ba Mungu migi ngo? maku giyeny pi ju ma kwo ba ju m’utho? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba cik man ba lembatuca! tek giweco ngo calku lembe maeni, andha rupiny umbe igi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gibikadhu kud i ie, ma can unegogi hai kec de negogi; man ebitimbre nia, kinde ma kec ubinegogi, gibiywagri gigi, man gibikwong’o kwong’ kud ubimo migi man ku Mungu migi, e gibiloko wang’gi malu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e gibineno yo ba ng’om, man, nen, lem ma tek ku mudho yimpiny mi ndiba; man jubiriemogi cen i mudho ma bii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
